# Host-local INLA-mapping verification artefacts (ADR 0019 §Decision 5
# / merged-v2 §3.4). Written by
# tests/testthat/test-factor-continuous-inla-verification.R when INLA
# is installed; consumed by
# .lgm_check_factor_numeric_interaction_inla_verified() to decide
# whether to accept the INLA emit path for factor:continuous
# indexed-slope terms. Per-host by design (carries INLA version,
# timestamp, agreement-table snapshot) -- must not enter shared
# history. Absence on a fresh checkout is the correct fail-safe:
# the gate refuses INLA dispatch with a v0.3 deferral message until
# the verification test has been run.
inst/extdata/inla-verification/

# Decision-knowledge ledger (cairns) -- local dev artefact, kept out of
# package git history (untracked 2026-05-30); already in .Rbuildignore.
ledger/

# pkgdown output (rebuilt by CI; not committed)
docs/

# Stress-harness outputs (generated; tools/ is also .Rbuildignore'd so
# never ships). The stress scripts themselves are tracked; only their
# results directory is local-only.
tools/stress_results/
